      "en": "The LORD’s word came to Zechariah, saying,",
      "ko": "여호와의 말씀이 스가랴에게 임하여 이르시되",
      "source_text_hash": "082575a87d038932ea4a8504e2e23a1c7c56e033ebedb50a369d5461482f3f50",
      "translation_text_hash": "2482838e06702127cfaef2c2526b982b2ae6175106d8da42a16b39d04b019b2c",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
