      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "ZEC",
          "chapter": 7,
          "verse": 11
        }
      ],
      "en": "But they refused to listen, and turned their backs, and stopped their ears, that they might not hear.",
      "ko": "그들이 청종하기를 싫어하여 등으로 향하며 듣지 아니하려고 귀를 막으며",
      "source_text_hash": "1b06b9f0c9ddb24f7cf7860e2ea530d47db0e93401b5825de865b8960b82008a",
      "translation_text_hash": "0d2aef8b02d2fe9e1fa98bd72861d57fb98e7afe3f90c499c39467c5d0010031",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "그들이 청종하기를 싫어하여 등으로 향하며 듣지 아니하려고 귀를 막으며"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "0d2aef8b02d2fe9e1fa98bd72861d57fb98e7afe3f90c499c39467c5d0010031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:ZEC:7:12",
      "sequence": 22975,
      "chapter_label": "ZEC 7",
      "verse_label": "12",
      "locator": {
